# Tor daemon for the onion-Mitra interop rig (`./dev up onion`).
#
# Two jobs at once, exactly like a small production deployment:
#  - SOCKS proxy for Plamenu's outbound .onion lane (host port 9350).
#  - Hidden service fronting the onion-identity Mitra that runs natively on
#    the host at port 8381.
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
Log notice stdout
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/hs
HiddenServicePort 80 host.docker.internal:8381
